  },
  "bio": [
   {
    "text": "Kaito spends weeks tailing Tameshi on Otawara and learns he is hiding secret deals and a secret project, then breaks into Tameshi's compound and finds a coded message and a blueprint of a strange device.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-2-lies-promises-and-neon-flames-2022-01-24-e6",
     "episode-2-lies-promises-and-neon-flames-2022-01-24-e7",
     "episode-2-lies-promises-and-neon-flames-2022-01-24-e8"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-lies-promises-and-neon-flames-2022-01-24#:~:text=And%20he%27d%20watched%20the,for%20the%20Towashi%20Undercity.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-lies-promises-and-neon-flames-2022-01-24#:~:text=No%20camera%20would%20see%20him%20now",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-lies-promises-and-neon-flames-2022-01-24#:~:text=The%20meeting%20was%20happening%20tonight%2C%20and%20soon"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Following the nezumi's rabbit drone to Otawara, Kaito is paralyzed by a moonfolk who turns out to be the planeswalker Tamiyo, and she tells him about Tezzeret and the Reality Chip.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24-e4",
     "episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24-e6",
     "episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24-e7",
     "episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24-e9"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24#:~:text=The%20tanuki%20followed%2C%20and,the%20direction%20of%20Otawara.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24#:~:text=%22I%20am%20Tamiyo%2C%22%20she,as%20unwavering%20as%20steel.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24#:~:text=%22You%27re%20a%20planeswalker.%22",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24#:~:text=%22The%20Wanderer%20and%20the,one%20and%20the%20same.%22"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Kaito then steals the Reality Chip from the lab, meets the monster Jin-Gitaxias, and is cornered by a dragon-shaped mech until the emperor, who is the Wanderer, cuts it down, after which the three planeswalkers flee Otawara.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24-e12",
     "episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24-e13",
     "episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24-e16",
     "episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24-e17"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24#:~:text=So%20Kaito%20reached%20out%2C,it%20in%20his%20pocket.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24#:~:text=The%20existence%20of%20a,plane%20is%20highly%20improbable",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24#:~:text=The%20Wanderer.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-unexpected-alliance-2022-01-24#:~:text=the%20three%20planeswalkers%20fled%20from%20Otawara%20in%20silence."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In Threads of War the Wanderer, Kaito and Tamiyo defeat the henchmen in the compound and hold Tezzeret paralyzed, and the group then flies to Eiganjo on a surveillance mech's back, carrying him.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-5-threads-war-2022-01-27-e0",
     "episode-5-threads-war-2022-01-27-e5"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-5-threads-war-2022-01-27#:~:text=%22Yes.%20We%20will%20decide%20his%20fate%20together.%22",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-5-threads-war-2022-01-27#:~:text=The%20mech%20let%20out,body%20to%20the%20ground"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In The Epoch Engine, Katsumasa shows Kotori the prototype mech and asks her to pilot it in secret.",
    "cites": [
     "epoch-engine-2022-02-08-e0",
     "p:stories/epoch-engine-2022-02-08"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/epoch-engine-2022-02-08#:~:text=I%20call%20this%20prime,to%20be%20its%20pilot.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/epoch-engine-2022-02-08"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "In 2024 Otawara is described as the gleaming Soratami stronghold in the sky where recovered artifacts are kept, and Kaito sneaks past its drones to steal an iron scroll.",
    "cites": [
     "p:stories/episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house",
     "episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house-e2"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house#:~:text=Pressing%20himself%20flat%20against,a%20drone%20soar%20by"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "He finds the scroll guarded by a spider kami's spirit web, and the Wanderer appears behind him to say she needs his help because Nashi is in trouble.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house-e4",
     "episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house-e5",
     "episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house-e6"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house#:~:text=A%20spider%20kami%20hung,a%20delicate%20spirit%20web",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house#:~:text=The%20white%2Dhaired%20woman%20standing,from%20completing%20a%20stroke.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-one-dont-go-past-the-old-dark-house#:~:text=I%20came%20because%20I,help.%20Nashi%27s%20in%20trouble."
    ]
   }
  ],
